{"type":"message","id":"adeb6f28","parentId":"905025a2","timestamp":"2026-08-31T17:05:26.909Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I need to set up my work plan for closing the nine audit-gap items from the previous records agent documentation, which are already detailed in the existing gap closure plan.\n\nLet me start by examining the current repository state and understanding what work remains. I'll begin with read-only exploration of the key files to understand the current implementation, then set up the task list before proceeding with implementation and verification across the nine work units. The remaining work units break down into documentation, tests, and final verification—most of which are fairly mechanical. I need to check the current state of the codebase for each area, then coordinate the implementation across work units in parallel where the file ownership doesn't conflict. Let me start by examining the key files involved. Now I'm ready to start exploring the codebase.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"chatcmpl-tool-83049a70136c0e18","name":"todo","arguments":{"action":"create","subject":"Explore current state of all 9 work units' files","activeForm":"Exploring current state of work-unit files"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"chatcmpl-tool-85a1ec5d3dffc7f6","name":"todo","arguments":{"action":"create","subject":"Work unit 1: canonical county resolver + legacy reconciliation + recorded-doc guards"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"chatcmpl-tool-baf0b15ae5c51fb5","name":"todo","arguments":{"action":"create","subject":"Work unit 3: atomic Copilot reclaim (CAS) + identifier redaction"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"chatcmpl-tool-9de5f7af2566488c","name":"todo","arguments":{"action":"create","subject":"Work unit 2: shared provenance contract on feed/task surfaces"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"chatcmpl-tool-b73278d0f37eeb29","name":"todo","arguments":{"action":"create","subject":"Work unit 4: light-only theme enforcement (viewport, CSS, providers)"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"chatcmpl-tool-977a766953f378eb","name":"todo","arguments":{"action":"create","subject":"Work unit 5: screening column order/semantics"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"chatcmpl-tool-8b5ee7e642363508","name":"todo","arguments":{"action":"create","subject":"Work unit 6: deterministic .env.local model config in records-local-stack.sh"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"chatcmpl-tool-bcdd6b58d565dbc6","name":"todo","arguments":{"action":"create","subject":"Work unit 7: doc/runbook corrections + seed-twice committed test"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"chatcmpl-tool-a07e164e00658843","name":"todo","arguments":{"action":"create","subject":"Work unit 8: missing browser + integration evidence"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"chatcmpl-tool-9a80bfdbc102518f","name":"todo","arguments":{"action":"create","subject":"Work unit 9: full verification + truthful closeout reports"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"qwen38-main","model":"qwen3.8-27b","usage":{"input":56055,"output":687,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":160,"totalTokens":56742,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1788195857389,"responseId":"chatcmpl-83f8a02f8deca198","rawStopReason":"tool_calls"}}
