ed, so failure must NOT un-confirm: treat as retryable audit/reconcile sub-step, not a task failure of the confirm itself — decide carefully)","Worker confirm flow order: confirmCountyParcel (CAS snapshot write) → backfill. The confirm route (confirm/route.ts) does NOT call backfill — only the worker does (3 sites). So a county-less legacy property confirmed via the SYNC route route still has no county written — another consistency gap (route-level confirm should reconcile too, or the read-side provenance backfill covers display; the WRITE-side gap matters for /api/coverage counts)","Recorded-documents guard inputs must mirror the search POST gate EXACTLY: resolveCountyCoverage(property.county, countyRecord?.snapshot?.provenance?.sourceId) — using property.county (NOT countyIdentityForProperty re-derivation) for parity","UI backward-compat: RecordedSearchResponse = RecordedSearch | RecordedSearchNotFound; isSearchResponse checks 'status' in SEARCH_STATUSES — additive fields (coverage, authoritative) keep it passing; add a client-safe CoverageProjection type to src/types/recorded-documents.ts or reuse screeningCoverageRow-shaped output","Screening page column work (WU5) + theme (WU4) + local-stack (WU6) are file-disjoint from WU1/WU3 — safe to delegate to 9B workers in separate lanes after WU1/WU3 land","copilot-actions.test.ts has a fake-Firestore harness (line ~99 special-cases copilotActionExecutions) — transactional CAS will need the fake harness to support runTransaction (check what it fakes before designing the concurrent-reclaim test)"],"decisions":["WU1 implementation (parent, high reasoning): (1) add a typed 'review' outcome to CountyCoverage for explicit-vs-provenance contradiction — contradiction ⇒ NOT live (fail closed): status stays the explicit county's registry status but a new discriminant `contradiction` already exists — EXTEND it into a fail-closed gate at every route (if contradiction && explicit!==provenance base → treat as blocked review state, n