ue row (Task 2).\n * The same canonical capability result the property-detail and coverage\n * APIs use, shaped for the table: non-live rows carry the honest reason\n * and next action in `message` (null for live rows, which carry the\n * source label instead). `status !== 'live'` means the property cannot\n\n[50 more lines in file. Use offset=440 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1788197182170}}
