: mapped all consumer call sites (properties/[id] GET:69/PATCH:171 pass null provenance; coverage/route explicit-only; screening inputs OK; confirm/refresh/resolve + recorded search POST pass provenance; worker requireLiveCounty 319 OK; recorded-documents root+polling reads UNGUARDED; worker backfillCountyBestEffort at 544/632 + auto-confirm site)"],"findings":["WorkerBlockedError(code: string) is free-form and classifyWorkerFailure maps ALL WorkerBlockedErrors to blocking — a new 'county_review' code is safe without touching BLOCKING_WORKER_CODES (that set is for CountyRecordsError codes)","confirmCountyParcel (CAS snapshot write) happens BEFORE the backfill in all 3 worker sites; a reconcile failure after a committed confirm must NOT un-confirm or fail the task (reconcile is idempotent, retried on next county work) — surface via error-level log + documented crash boundary","Synchronous county routes only ENQUEUE (the worker owns the confirm write) — so no route-level backfill change needed; the only write-side owner is the worker","Recorded-documents UI (recorded-documents-section.tsx): loadState fetches root endpoint, poll fetches searches/[searchId]; isSearchResponse checks only 'status' ∈ SEARCH_STATUSES → additive fields are backward-compatible; component currently has NO coverage rendering (only a CoverageLedger of index results) — add a notice banner for authoritative:false","Seed has NO county-less-with-confirmed-snapshot property (all six carry explicit county or null-without-record) — the WU1 emulator integration test must CREATE such a legacy property itself to exercise reconciliation","notCoveredPayload non-review branches no longer carry the contradiction note (contradiction is exclusively the review branch now) — the `note` variable was removed with a comment explaining why"],"decisions":["Review state displays the EXPLICIT county (user's assertion) with registry name when known; provenance named in the message","Recorded read guard uses the SAME reso