{"type":"message","id":"b8247f4f","parentId":"24945fba","timestamp":"2026-08-31T17:40:53.691Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The checkpoint has become due. Generation 9 has already been committed, but the banner file and the fetchWatchlist changes in the properties page have not been reflected yet. I'll write generation 10, then continue work on the pill wiring (line 797) in the properties page.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"chatcmpl-tool-a326fe820b1d8d20","name":"checkpoint_notes","arguments":{"current":"WU1 in progress (parent session; worktree /Users/evanhuang/brickspect/dashboard/.worktrees/records-agent-launch @ a9eeff9, branch feat/records-agent-launch; no commits yet). DONE (all diagnostics clean): capabilities.ts (review fail-closed status, notCoveredPayload 'review' branch, coverageNote), capabilities.test.ts (review semantics), ScreeningCoverage + 'review', properties/[id] GET+PATCH provenance, /api/coverage provenance-aware + review ORDER tier, /api/properties list additive coverage map (+2 tests updated), properties/page.tsx fetchWatchlist now parses coverage map (PropertyCoverageNote interface added, exported), county-coverage-banner.tsx: CoveragePill review variant (amber, data-testid coverage-pill-review) + CountyCoverageBanner 'review' case (names both counties, paused-work message) + showForm includes review + chip label 'Needs review'. REMAINING WU1: (1) properties/page.tsx pill at ~line 797 — replace resolveCountyCoverage(p.county ?? null, null) with a note-shaped input: CoveragePill expects CountyCoverage, so either adapt CoveragePill to accept the note OR build a minimal CountyCoverage from the note (simplest: local map note→CountyCoverage with county+status, no eta/source; review keeps contradiction — but note has no contradiction → extend note to carry contradiction OR have the pill fall back to a review marker via status only). (2) recorded-documents root GET + searches/