(guardNotice helper, amber p w/ recorded-coverage-notice testid; set in loadState AND poll). NOW: (1) firestore/properties.ts: replace non-atomic backfillWatchlistCounty (read-then-set; only worker calls it via local helper) with transactional reconcileWatchlistCounty(uid,propertyId,county,sourceId) → reconciled/already_reconciled(explicit same base)/explicit_conflict/property_gone; explicit county NEVER overwritten; tx.set merge {county, countyReconciledFrom: sourceId, countyReconciledAt} only when county absent; errors propagate (drop the warn-catch). (2) agent-worker.ts: local backfillCountyBestEffort (line 343, called at ~2 sites: confirm + refresh; early-returns if item.county) — replace body to call reconcileWatchlistCounty; genuine error → console.error (task still succeeds: confirm durable, idempotent re-attempt on next county work); requireLiveCounty (~319): coverage.status==='review' → WorkerBlockedError('county_review', message) (currently falls through to unsupported_county path). (3) WU1 tests: reconcile unit matrix (reconciled/already/conflict/gone); emulator: create legacy county-less property WITH confirmed Cuyahoga snapshot (seed lacks one), reconcile twice (stable county, zero dup tasks/events); route agreement (detail/coverage/list/recorded-read same county+status); review zero-write (search/confirm/refresh → 422, no writes). THEN WU3 (Copilot CAS+redaction), WU2, WU4-7, WU8, WU9.","completed":["WU1: capabilities.ts review fail-closed + notCoveredPayload + coverageNote (clean)","WU1: capabilities.test.ts review-semantics tests (clean)","WU1: ScreeningCoverage + 'review' (clean)","WU1: properties/[id] GET+PATCH provenance (clean)","WU1: /api/coverage + /api/properties provenance-aware + tests (clean)","WU1: properties/page.tsx note consumption + pill widening (clean)","WU1: county-coverage-banner review rendering (clean)","WU1: RecordedCoverageNote types + recordedReadGuard (clean)","WU1: both recorded-read routes {authoritative, coverage} (clean)","WU1: recorded-documents-section coverage notice (clean)"],"findings":["Worker backfill path: local backfillCountyBestEffort (line 343) wraps backfillWatchlistCounty (line 94, non-atomic read-then-set) with a warn-catch; called from 2 sites (confirm, refresh); auto-confirm path also reaches it — need to verify all call sites before replacing","updateWatchlistItemCounty (line 116, PATCH path) overwrites unconditionally by design (user assertion is source of truth) — leave it; reconcile must never use it","WatchlistItem has no countyReconciledFrom/countyReconciledAt fields — write them as extra doc fields (Firestore tolerates) but they must not break parseCountyIdentity or the WatchlistItem reader (extra fields are ignored by readers)"],"decisions":["Reconcile writes {county, countyReconciledFrom: sourceId, countyReconciledAt: now} only when county absent; explicit-conflict never writes; same-base explicit → already_reconciled (no normalize)"],"failed_approaches":[],"blockers":[],"verification":["pi-lens clean on all WU1 files edited so far (advisories only: inline-styles/redundant-state — pre-existing patterns, no action)"],"next_action":"Implement reconcileWatchlistCounty in src/lib/firestore/properties.ts (runTransaction; keep old backfillWatchlistCounty only if other callers exist — verify), then update the worker's backfillCountyBestEffort + requireLiveCounty review branch, then run the worker unit tests."}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"qwen38-main","model":"qwen3.8-27b","usage":{"input":124660,"output":1344,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":266,"totalTokens":126004,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1788198741955,"responseId":"chatcmpl-9188d7e741882e43","rawStopReason":"tool_calls"}}
