Id]/route.ts`\n  - `/Users/evanhuang/brickspect/dashboard/.worktrees/records-agent-launch/src/components/records-dashboard/recorded-documents-section.tsx`\n- Key files still to modify for WU1:\n  - `/Users/evanhuang/brickspect/dashboard/.worktrees/records-agent-launch/src/lib/firestore/properties.ts`\n  - `/Users/evanhuang/brickspect/dashboard/.worktrees/records-agent-launch/src/lib/agent-worker.ts`\n  - WU1 test files (unit matrix, emulator integration, route agreement, zero-write tests).\n- Key existing functions/types relevant to remaining WU1 work:\n  - `resolveCountyCoverage(county, confirmedSourceId)` in `src/lib/county-records/capabilities.ts`\n  - `notCoveredPayload(coverage)` in `src/lib/county-records/capabilities.ts`\n  - `coverageNote(coverage)` in `src/lib/county-records/capabilities.ts`\n  - `screeningCoverageRow(coverage)` in `src/lib/county-records/capabilities.ts`\n  - `coverageForScreening(county, record)` in `src/lib/screening/inputs.ts`\n  - `getCountyRecord(uid, propertyId)` in `src/lib/firestore/county-records.ts`\n  - `getWatchlistItem(uid, propertyId)` in `src/lib/firestore/properties.ts`\n  - `backfillWatchlistCounty` currently in `src/lib/firestore/properties.ts` (line ~94) — non-atomic read-then-set; to be superseded by transactional `reconcileWatchlistCounty`.\n  - `backfillCountyBestEffort` in `src/lib/agent-worker.ts` at three call sites (auto-confirm, confirm ~line 544, refresh ~line 632) — to be replaced.\n  - `requireLiveCounty` in `src/lib/agent-worker.ts` — must map `review` to `WorkerBlockedError('county_review', ...)`.\n  - `recordedReadGuard(user, propertyId)` in `src/app/api/properties/[id]/recorded-documents/shared.ts`\n  - `guardNotice(payload)` in `src/components/records-dashboard/recorded-documents-section.tsx`\n  - `isSearchResponse(payload)` in `src/components/records-dashboard/recorded-documents-section.tsx`\n  - `RecordedSearchResponse = RecordedSearch | RecordedSearchNotFound` in `src/types/recorded-documents.ts`\n  - `RecordedCoverageNote` and `RecordedSearchGuardedResponse` in `src/types/recorded-documents.ts`\n  - `PropertyCoverageNote` in `src/app/properties/page.tsx`\n  - `CountyCoverage` union in `src/lib/county-records/capabilities.ts`\n  - `ScreeningCoverage` in `src/types/screening.ts`\n- Important semantic invariants:\n  - Explicit county is the only routing input except provenance backfill for missing county identity.\n  - Provenance backfill applies only when the explicit county is absent.\n  - Contradiction between explicit county and provenance is fail-closed `review`, not a routing note.\n  - County identity is never inferred from state/address; bare slug and registry slug are compared after stripping the two-letter state token.\n  - Non-live coverage states block county work with zero writes.\n  - Recorded-document reads may return stale stored results, but only with `authoritative: false` when coverage is no longer live.\n- Seed data context:\n  - `scripts/seed-records-demo.ts` currently seeds six demo properties with explicit county or null county, but it does **not** seed a county-less property with a confirmed county snapshot.\n  - The WU1 emulator test must create that legacy state itself to verify reconciliation.\n- Error messages encountered and resolved during WU1 edits:\n  - `🔴 STOP — 3 issue(s) must be fixed: L407: Cannot find name 'note'.` in `src/lib/county-records/capabilities.ts` after removing the old permissive `note` variable; fixed by removing references from non-review branches.\n  - `L260: Cannot find name 'coverageNote'.` in `src/lib/county-records/__tests__/capabilities.test.ts`; fixed by adding `coverageNote` to the import block.\n  - `L333: Declaration or statement expected.` in `src/lib/county-records/__tests__/capabilities.test.ts` after an edit left an extra closing brace; fixed by removing the duplicate `});`.\n  - `L811: Type 'PropertyCoverageNote' is not assignable to type 'CountyCoverage'. ... missing ... eta, source` in `src/app/properties/page.tsx`; fixed by widening `CoveragePill`’s `coverage` prop to `{ status: CountyCoverage['status'] }`.\n  - `Property '__placeholder__' does not exist on type ...` in `src/app/api/properties/[id]/recorded-documents/shared.ts` after an accidental draft placeholder replaced `requireRecordedProperty`; fixed by restoring `requireRecordedProperty` and adding the real `recordedReadGuard` implementation.\n  - `Validation failed for tool \"checkpoint_notes\": current: must not have more than 2048 characters` occurred multiple times; resolved by shortening the checkpoint `current` field and committing generation 13.\n- Partial-edit / content-drift issues encountered:\n  - An import edit to `src/app/api/properties/route.ts` initially failed because the actual import block included `upsertWatchlistItem`; re-read and fixed.\n  - A multi-block edit to `src/app/api/properties/[id]/recorded-documents/route.ts` initially failed because the import line was `import { NO_STORE, requireRecordedProperty } from './shared';` rather than the guessed line; re-read and applied the correct edit.\n  - A multi-block edit to `src/app/properties/page.tsx` partially applied due to state-declaration text mismatch; re-read and applied the remaining edits.\n- Diagnostics status:\n  - The WU1-edited files reported clean JavaScript/TypeScript diagnostics after their fixes, except for advisory-only lint hints such as inline styles and redundant-state patterns, which are pre-existing or intentional.\n- Previously read files (from earlier session context):\n  - `/Users/evanhuang/.pi/agent/dev/pi-subagents-local/README.md`\n  - `/Users/evanhuang/brickspect/dashboard/.worktrees/records-agent-launch/src/app/api/copilot/proposals/execute/route.ts`\n  - `/Users/evanhuang/brickspect/dashboard/.worktrees/records-agent-launch/src/app/api/coverage/route.ts`\n  - `/Users/evanhuang/brickspect/dashboard/.worktrees/records-agent-launch/src/app/api/properties/[id]/recorded-documents/route.ts`\n  - `/Users/eva