n\n## Findings\n- properties/[id] route.test.ts fails 6/13: mock factory has no getCountyRecord (500s); the file was only sed-viewed, so the read-before-edit guard requires a Read-tool read before the edit lands\n- Jest pattern pitfall: bracketed paths like [id] must be quoted/escaped in the jest pattern argument or they match zero files\n\n## Decisions\n- Unit tests mock getCountyRecord to resolve null by default (county-less property → unknown coverage) unless a test sets it otherwise\n\n## Failed Approaches\n- edit tool call on the route.test.ts was rejected (no prior Read-tool read of that file) — must Read it first, then re-emit the same edit\n\n## Verification\n- capabilities + properties-list suites pass (48/48); 4 route suites failing on mock gaps/stale expectations (being fixed)\n\n## Blockers\n- None.\n\n## Next Action\nRead-tool read of src/app/api/properties/[id]/__tests__/route.test.ts, retry the jest.mock add; then inspect the recorded-documents + searches/[searchId] + county-records/resolve test files and fix their mocks/expectations; re-run npx jest src/app/api/properties until green.\n\n## Working Set\n- `/Users/evanhuang/brickspect/dashboard/.worktrees/records-agent-launch/src/app/api/coverage/route.ts`\n- `/Users/evanhuang/brickspect/dashboard/.worktrees/records-agent-launch/src/app/api/properties/[id]/recorded-documents/route.ts`\n- `/Users/evanhuang/brickspect/dashboard/.worktrees/records-agent-launch/src/app/api/properties/[id]/recorded-documents/searches/[searchId]/route.ts`\n- `/Users/evanhuang/brickspect/dashboard/.worktrees/records-agent-launch/src/app/api/properties/[id]/recorded-documents/shared.ts`\n- `/Users/evanhuang/brickspect/dashboard/.worktrees/records-agent-launch/src/app/api/properties/[id]/route.ts`\n- `/Users/evanhuang/brickspect/dashboard/.worktrees/records-agent-launch/src/app/api/properties/__tests__/route.test.ts`\n- `/Users/evanhuang/brickspect/dashboard/.worktrees/records-agent-launch/src/app/api/properties/route.ts`\n- `