both closeout reports with the same final commit SHA, exact commands/exits/counts, skipped tests, environment limitations, and intentional deferrals, then stop for `GoalJudge` and `GoalVerifier`.\n\n## Critical Context\n- `loopId`: `7ba885b3-76f1-4ab1-89ca-6a3d84043866`\n- `originalPlan` path: `/Users/evanhuang/.pi/agent/goal-loops/7ba885b3-76f1-4ab1-89ca-6a3d84043866/original-plan.md`\n- `originalPlan` hash: `b1642915c461fd2e2b379dd15404f144542a94533bea65b33b1b9e0fd0a1637a`\n- Audited commit: `a9eeff99715775a7392e8cc8ab367e5ee3f5a4be`\n- Current branch/worktree:\n  - branch `feat/records-agent-launch`\n  - worktree `~/brickspect/dashboard/.worktrees/records-agent-launch`\n  - main checkout `~/brickspect/dashboard` on `main` at `450773f`\n- **No commits have been made yet in this session**; all WU1 changes (implementation + test fixes + new test file) are uncommitted working-tree edits in the worktree.\n- Latest checkpoint notes:\n  - path: `/Users/evanhuang/.pi/agent/notes/9b3f771d-b43a-45a1-a4e6-1cad29d7d7c4/NOTES.md`\n  - latest generation committed: `26` (sha256 `5319f8c7a781`); generations 14–26 committed during this segment.\n  - Gen-26 current status: WU1 implementation complete and all existing tests green (unit + recorded-documents emulator 8/8); reconcile unit matrix 6/6 PASS; now writing the county-reconcile emulator integration test.\n- **Firestore emulator: RUNNING** (started this session): `docker compose up -d firestore-emulator` → container `records-agent-launch-firestore-emulator-1`, `localhost:8095`, project `demo-brickspect-dashboard`. `jest.setup.integration.js` sets `FIRESTORE_EMULATOR_HOST`, `FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID=demo-brickspect-dashboard`, `ALLOW_DEV_AUTH=true`, deletes `GOOGLE_CLOUD_PROJECT_ID`, `NODE_ENV=test`. Keep it up for all remaining integration/E2E work (WU1 emulator test, WU8, WU9).\n- Original user input was `icontinue` (typo for “continue”), asking the assistant to proceed with executing the Records Agent Final Audit-Gap Closure Pla