{"type":"message","id":"bda71a70","parentId":"fbb5e0a9","timestamp":"2026-08-31T18:48:25.284Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I need to investigate this further. Let me check the details.\n\nAdvisory only — no action needed. The grep for the `CountyProviderOptions` interface in types/county-records.ts turned up nothing (the interface must be in a different location). And interestingly, the fixture's `fetchParcelSnapshot` doesn't call requireOwnCounty (it only reads scenario). So the only thing that needed the county option was `resolveCandidates`. Find the type of CountyProviderOptions:\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"chatcmpl-tool-b8b31a750c328dad","name":"bash","arguments":{"command":"grep -rn \"CountyProviderOptions\" src/lib/county-records/capabilities.ts src/types/ 2>/dev/null | head -5; grep -rn \"type CountyProviderOptions\\|interface CountyProviderOptions\" src/ | head -3"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"qwen38-main","model":"qwen3.8-27b","usage":{"input":74334,"output":179,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":100,"totalTokens":74513,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1788202099793,"responseId":"chatcmpl-bf39723787f47a5d","rawStopReason":"tool_calls"}}
