ITTED ac6ee29 (23 files, +1370/-95, hooks clean, no AI attribution); working tree clean except untracked plans doc","WU3 design done (deeper reasoning enabled): read copilot-actions.ts fully (claimExecution/recordGateOutcome = read-then-unconditional-update race; targetId+idempotencyKey persisted verbatim; no schemaVersion), plan WU3 section (L63-84), test harness (createFakeDb L63: store Map, makeDoc get/create/update/set, options failCreate/failFinalize; fixtures L168-305; record-asserting tests L688 (asserts raw idempotencyKey 'ui:message-1' + attempts 1), L860 redaction, L903 cross-user, L935 stale-settle)","Confirmed: only src/app/api/copilot/proposals/execute/route.ts references the collection (comment) — no other readers of CopilotActionExecution"],"current":"WU3 implementation NEXT (parent; worktree .worktrees/records-agent-launch @ ac6ee29, branch feat/records-agent-launch; emulator UP :8095). DESIGN (settled): (1) add withExecutionRecord(uid, fp, fn) wrapping getFirestoreDb().runTransaction — tx.get snapshot → fn decides; fresh→tx.create; reclaim→tx.update {state:'executing', updatedAt, attempts+1}; replay/interrupted→no write; commit conflict→SDK re-runs closure→re-decides (exactly one winner); withExecutionRecord catch→unavailable. claimExecution: fast read outside tx first (replay/fresh-inflight fast path), else tx path. recordGateOutcome: same tx primitive (terminal→replay, fresh→interrupted, stale/absent→terminal-failed write). (2) redaction: export keyedIdentifierRef(uid, fp, 'target'|'key', value)=sha256Hex(`${uid}|${fp}|${field}|${value}`); new records store targetRef+keyRef (64-hex), NEVER raw targetId/idempotencyKey; interface gains schemaVersion?: number (new writes =2) and makes targetId?/idempotencyKey? optional (v1 legacy read-compat; replay/isFreshInFlight/isTerminal untouched). (3) doc crash-boundary in module header (domain mutation + terminal audit transition non-atomic by design; reconcile via idempotent/CAS seams). (4) tests: extend fak